-- GENERATED by watkinsglen_implementation/recovery/lift/gen_track.py from track_host.luau; do not edit.
-- NR2003CupTrack: the ORIGINAL NR2003 track and collision world, run on the car's core memory by code lifted from
-- NR2003.exe (NR2003CupTrackCode*) over the track image (NR2003CupTrackData*: what the ORIGINAL track load, track build,
-- track.ini loaders and 00573010 track init leave in memory; Unicorn reference recovery/orig_world.py).
--
--   V.loadTrack()          the track image into the reset image and the memory; garage rebuild inputs follow it
--   session start / reset  (NR2003CupFrame applySession11 -&gt; V.enterTrack, wrapped here):
--                          00566e50 world part: 0059fa90 BG car object, 00433cb0 collision geometry (4 tyre spheres +
--                          body spheres, collision object c7e75c), 00578610 world reset, car+0x5ae = world record;
--                          00550a50 subset with 005512f0 placement on the track at its place (@00550aeb, V._place);
--                          00563620 race-order insert
